1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,680
I offer my clients

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:06,960
very caring support,
to be honest.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:10,220
We stay in touch
between sessions,

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:13,320
and I can support you,
because I know that real life,

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:17,540
triggers, reactions and pain
do not happen only there,

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,740
when we are facing each other
during our session.

7
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,220
They happen in everyday life.

8
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:26,660
I want them to have a way
to reach out to me,

9
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:30,620
within the availability
I can realistically offer.
